# The Wails CLI rewrites generated bindings and the NSIS templates on every
# build using LF, while core.autocrlf wants CRLF in the working tree. Without
# this, those files show as modified after every build even though not one
# character of content changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.exe  binary
*.syso binary
*.woff2 binary

# Committed so a plain `go build` gets the tray's icon without needing
# go-winres installed. Regenerate with:
#   go run github.com/tc-hib/go-winres@v0.3.3 simply --icon build\windows\icon.ico
*.syso binary
